g r a p h i c a l a b s t r a c t
The redox coprecipitation reaction between the Fe foil, $\mathsf{H}_{3}\mathsf{B T C}$ molecules and GO sheets in mild hydrothermal condition leads to the in situ formation of Fe-BTC MOFs directly on the RGO sheets. The RGO sheets effectively inhibit the severe aggregation of small sized Fe-BTC domains, and the well distributed Fe-BTC domains could prevent the spontaneous restacking of the RGO sheets.
